            "sid": "AMO 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mbathi sya ĩkalũ ikatw’ĩka iĩo mũthenya ũsu, easya ũu Mwĩaĩi Yeova: simba ikeethĩwa nyingĩ; kĩla vandũ makasyĩkya nza mavindĩtye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
